& [FSC5FinalSliceSurfaceV1] is the executable final-slice surface for FSC5 operations safety envelope
  + [chunk_ref] is FSC5 operations safety envelope
  + [chunk_boundary] is P9 operations-manager safety and future machine control plus P8e dry-run resource fixtures
  + [accepted_boundary_input] is docs/planning/FSC4_Surface_Projection_Pack.v1.sop
