  + [gated_slice_set] is FSC5-S02, FSC5-S03, FSC5-S04, FSC5-S05, and FSC5-S06
  + [safety_limit] is no live operations control authorized

  = must: execute FSC5-S01 before any other FSC5 slice
  = must: run completed-work review after each slice
  = must: stale downstream slices when an upstream output changes or contradicts the current slice assumptions
  = must: reject any output that authorizes live process, GPU, model runtime, job, credential, network, or destructive filesystem control

